    "title": "Inmate dies in Petersburg federal prison - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By FOX Richmond ,\n1 days ago Jun. 23, 2026 — PETERSBURG, Va. (WWBT) - John Archie McNeill, Jr., 38, is dead after he was found unresponsive at Petersburg Low in Hopewell, according to a press release. Employees at the prison tried life-saving measures until an ambulance arrived, but McNeill was pronounced dead by EMS services. Read full article",
